(* eh2-pq-kem-broken.pv - ML-KEM broken: after the sessions the attacker learns
   every initiator ML-KEM secret key (hence every ss) and both identity keys.
   SK must stay secret on the ephemeral DHs alone. *)
query attacker(secretI) phase 1.
query attacker(secretR) phase 1.

process World | LeakStatics | LeakKem
